    categoryName: "Maintenance & Care",
    title: "Chemical Damage: How Imbalanced Pool Water Can Eat Away at Your Cover",
    excerpt:
      "Water chemistry does not just affect swimmers and equipment. Imbalanced water quietly destroys cover fabric, stitching, and hardware. Here is how to protect it.",
    image: IMG.chem,
